= When I'm not in front of my desk

I enjoy all kinds of "moving" — hiking, skiing, yoga. I'm also trying to get back into bouldering, slowly, because my knees have started sending passive-aggressive messages.

When I'm not in motion, I'm deep in a TV show binge or reading.

This site is a little peek into some work, some wanderings, and a bunch of things in between.

